The tab Pull requests is a table: Display chooses its columns (status, title, organization,
repository, number, creator, created), which CSS shows and hides at once; without the status, the
link to GitHub of each row has the color of its status. A menu at the top right shows 10, 25, 50
or 100 a page, also for the JSON (``per_page``, at most 100). The filters by state are removed.
